'''Buccaneers' Laboratory''' is located on [[Buccaneers' Haven]], therefore requiring 76 [[Sailing]] to access.

The entire laboratory is a [[multicombat area]], and a [[dwarven multicannon]] can be used here. There are a total of:

*8 [[Mutated Bloodveld|mutated bloodveld]]s to the north-east
*5 [[hellhound]]s in the centre
*11 [[shadow spider]]s to the south-east
*2 [[skeleton]]s to the west

The [[small key (Buccaneers' Haven)]] can be dug up by digging on the [[Ball (scenery)|red ball]] in the second-most westward prison cell in the north-west of the laboratory.
